Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"95.158.49.2","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69230,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8c36bde3a48bfda0a613f0a2dfec896b","RawContent":"[quote name=\"RitvikSehgal\" post=\"1913458\" timestamp=\"1462859482\"]\nI will suggest you to ask your Event Management Company to deal with this.\nGenerally wedding planner also provides designer to designs dresses under budgets and they also knows which dress will suites best as per destination.\n[img]https:\/\/s-media-cache-ak0.pinimg.com\/236x\/40\/86\/35\/408635f37c563f60965755d6fb3280b8.jpg[\/img][img]http:\/\/www.indianfashionlife.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2015\/04\/Designer-Engagement-Dresses-For-Indian-Bride-in-red-Color.jpg[\/img][\/quote]I love these dresses!!!","Attachments":[],"Id":1914614,"PostDate":1467432370,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>RitvikSehgal, on 10 May 2016 - 01:51 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>I will suggest you to ask your <a href='#' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Event Management Company<\/a> to deal with this.<\/p>\n<p>Generally wedding planner also provides designer to designs dresses under budgets and they also knows which dress will suites best as per destination.<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/s-media-cache-ak0.pinimg.com\/236x\/40\/86\/35\/408635f37c563f60965755d6fb3280b8.jpg\" alt=\"408635f37c563f60965755d6fb3280b8.jpg\"><\/span><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/www.indianfashionlife.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2015\/04\/Designer-Engagement-Dresses-For-Indian-Bride-in-red-Color.jpg\" alt=\"Designer-Engagement-Dresses-For-Indian-B\"><\/span><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>I love these dresses!!!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span><span style=\"font-size:14.6667px;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:transparent;\">Event planner and curator at <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.poptop.uk.com'>http:\/\/www.poptop.uk.com<\/a>\u00a0<\/span><span style=\"font-size:14.6667px;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:transparent;\"><strong>Poptop <\/strong>event marketplace <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/span><\/span>","Email":"svitlanapoptop@gmail.com","IpAddress":"95.158.49.2","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1467098318,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"SvitlanaG","Id":287249,"Name":"SvitlanaG","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"69230","Title":"Dresses from Dressilyme","LastPostDate":1467432370},"Pages":{"TotalItems":41,"TotalPages":5,"CurrentPage":40,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":30,"LastPage":40},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
