> User jacquewedding (283943)
Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"112.133.246.12","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69230,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0098d1bb52d67d9ee7ddf222e5675c5a","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;New Year Greetings to all my fellas here!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I also bought my bridal dress from Dressilyme online store. I actually was quiet surprised to see my dress in right size and shade as I had ordered.. I recall that initially there was some dilly dallying from my side in ordering from&amp;nbsp;Dressilyme but they did not disappoint.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I was quiet selective in terms of price and timelines as I was already late in ordering mine... Guess I was lucky to have got my dress well in time.. Am happy and would be keen to share more of my inputs on the wedding preparations to all my friend here.!!!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n\n\t&amp;nbsp;","Attachments":[{"Id":34568,"Name":"Dress1.png","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_12_2015\/post-285695-0-11116600-1451281215.png","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_12_2015\/post-285695-0-11116600-1451281215_thumb.png","Width":249,"Height":396},{"Id":34569,"Name":"Dress2.png","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_12_2015\/post-285695-0-37939500-1451281228.png","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_12_2015\/post-285695-0-37939500-1451281228_thumb.png","Width":558,"Height":665}],"Id":1908725,"PostDate":1451267115,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>New Year Greetings to all my fellas here!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I also bought my bridal dress from Dressilyme online store. I actually was quiet surprised to see my dress in right size and shade as I had ordered.. I recall that initially there was some dilly dallying from my side in ordering from\u00a0Dressilyme but they did not disappoint.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I was quiet selective in terms of price and timelines as I was already late in ordering mine... Guess I was lucky to have got my dress well in time.. Am happy and would be keen to share more of my inputs on the wedding preparations to all my friend here.!!!\u00a0<\/p>\n\n\t\u00a0\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sharmasraj10@gmail.com","IpAddress":"112.133.246.12","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1451266396,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"RajniS","Id":285695,"Name":"RajniS","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"95.31.111.126","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69230,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"963f982b650659e4cfe5f0982765439c","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;HI, I just want to share my expirience with dressilyme.com. It was better than my expectations&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I ordered fantastic open back wedding dress from dressilyme.com and I was so nervous about it. The picture on web site looks great but what it will be in reality? When my order was delivered I was pleasantly surprised. It looks exactly as on picture, well may be laces were a little bit different but in general it was fantastic. I recommend dressilyme.com to everyone.&amp;nbsp; :D&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1911697,"PostDate":1457553459,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>HI, I just want to share my expirience with dressilyme.com. It was better than my expectations<\/p>\n<p>I ordered fantastic open back wedding dress from dressilyme.com and I was so nervous about it. The picture on web site looks great but what it will be in reality? When my order was delivered I was pleasantly surprised. It looks exactly as on picture, well may be laces were a little bit different but in general it was fantastic. I recommend dressilyme.com to everyone.\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/biggrin.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':D' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"cecilyhutson@gmail.com","IpAddress":"128.70.146.50","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1457290962,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"TinaVerdin","Id":286424,"Name":"TinaVerdin","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"50.180.52.177","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69230,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3513bc948df6c649ddbb7578ea4f7e55","RawContent":"It&#039;s good to see such positive experiences, I was planning on buying a second dress for the reception and have heard such bad experiences regarding sizing but this puts my mind at ease just a little","Attachments":[],"Id":1911790,"PostDate":1457731046,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                It's good to see such positive experiences, I was planning on buying a second dress for the reception and have heard such bad experiences regarding sizing but this puts my mind at ease just a little\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lmf0408@gmail.com","IpAddress":"208.54.64.217","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1423561966,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Cablelove11","Id":282063,"Name":"Cablelove11","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"77.106.229.40","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69230,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e92100136b1715afb4ca56e649533a5b","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;My wedding dress fits perfectly\n\nI have just received the dress and fits wonderful, I was so nervous about it because it takes 3 weeks for delivery and during these 3 weeks I lost 10 pounds. I thought it would look like a potato bag on me, but a corset in a dress and laces on the back saved me. I like the quality, tailoring and fabric. Despite some mix reviews about dressilyme.com everything went great with my order. Personally I recommend dressilyme.com to everyone.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:simsun;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12pt;\"&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1912055,"PostDate":1458476360,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>My wedding dress fits perfectly<br>\nI have just received the dress and fits wonderful, I was so nervous about it because it takes 3 weeks for delivery and during these 3 weeks I lost 10 pounds. I thought it would look like a potato bag on me, but a corset in a dress and laces on the back saved me. I like the quality, tailoring and fabric. Despite some mix reviews about dressilyme.com everything went great with my order. Personally I recommend dressilyme.com to everyone.<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-family:simsun\"><span  style=\"font-size:12pt\"><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kristeenrider@gmail.com","IpAddress":"77.106.229.40","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1458475947,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"KristeenRider","Id":286526,"Name":"KristeenRider","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"85.187.252.242","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69230,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"018b7f25031ab12b0daad89796e934a9","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;My experience with dressilyme was great. i only wish i had ordered longer the ivory bodice. i also measured my sleeves wrong so they were short but my seamstress added lace to lengthen it. i loved my dress and so did others. it was so classy and sophisticated. it was better than what imagined. it really came together after the accessories were added (hair, makeup, jewelry, shoes). i would order again definitely. it was worth every penny.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[{"Id":35546,"Name":"wwd20298-1.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_04_2016\/post-286827-0-22936100-1461740907.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_04_2016\/post-286827-0-22936100-1461740907_thumb.jpg","Width":640,"Height":960}],"Id":1913142,"PostDate":1461726556,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>My experience with dressilyme was great. i only wish i had ordered longer the ivory bodice. i also measured my sleeves wrong so they were short but my seamstress added lace to lengthen it. i loved my dress and so did others. it was so classy and sophisticated. it was better than what imagined. it really came together after the accessories were added (hair, makeup, jewelry, shoes). i would order again definitely. it was worth every penny.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ammie@abv.bg","IpAddress":"85.187.252.242","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1461726095,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Meckaw","Id":286827,"Name":"Meckaw","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"122.15.103.61","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69230,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7dae59da94b98cb4f5755b4a1dc7d827","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I will suggest you to ask your &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;#&#039;&gt;Event Management Company&lt;\/a&gt; to deal with this.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Generally wedding planner also provides designer to designs dresses under budgets and they also knows which dress will suites best as per destination.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/s-media-cache-ak0.pinimg.com\/236x\/40\/86\/35\/408635f37c563f60965755d6fb3280b8.jpg\" alt=\"408635f37c563f60965755d6fb3280b8.jpg\"&gt;&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/www.indianfashionlife.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2015\/04\/Designer-Engagement-Dresses-For-Indian-Bride-in-red-Color.jpg\" alt=\"Designer-Engagement-Dresses-For-Indian-B\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1913458,"PostDate":1462845082,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I will suggest you to ask your <a href='#' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Event Management Company<\/a> to deal with this.<\/p>\n<p>Generally wedding planner also provides designer to designs dresses under budgets and they also knows which dress will suites best as per destination.<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/s-media-cache-ak0.pinimg.com\/236x\/40\/86\/35\/408635f37c563f60965755d6fb3280b8.jpg\" alt=\"408635f37c563f60965755d6fb3280b8.jpg\"><\/span><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/www.indianfashionlife.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2015\/04\/Designer-Engagement-Dresses-For-Indian-Bride-in-red-Color.jpg\" alt=\"Designer-Engagement-Dresses-For-Indian-B\"><\/span><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"katherineriverace@gmail.com","IpAddress":"122.15.103.61","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1425086317,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282278.png?_r=1425103909","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":242,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"RitvikSehgal","Id":282278,"Name":"RitvikSehgal","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"122.15.103.61","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69230,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"61c26f74b907bbfe4184816cd1bc4b83","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;It looks cool and pretty. Generally my clients seeks for such types of dresses.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1913478,"PostDate":1462853282,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>It looks cool and pretty. Generally my clients seeks for such types of dresses.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bharatkirayabhandar.com\/'>http:\/\/www.bharatkirayabhandar.com\/<\/a>","Email":"arijitjindal@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"122.15.103.61","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1454482596,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-286120.jpg?_r=1454497509","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"arjit","Id":286120,"Name":"arjit","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"104.131.243.162","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69230,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e9e0ad4c6c284e4e1290339840b72e01","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I have mixed feedback for my dress that I got from dressilyme. I picked a dress STYLE NO. WWD19107 for my wedding. I picked it in Ivory. It got beautiful tulle fabric skirt outside and soft organza within. The lace appliqu\u00e9s were nice and was even on the dress. It shipped it to me on time and with care. Got it on 5th day after they shipped it from China. Coming back to my dress, I found the lace is different than what was in the picture. However, I love this one more. It got big leaves and looks so lovely. Love it. However, I have been working out and lost 10 pounds since I ordered the dress. It&#039;s not their fault! I took it to seamstress and got it fitted\u2026 I actually love it more than what I have ordered 3 weeks earlier.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I would love to share the pictures of me in it. Unfortunately, I can&#039;t upload it from my iPad.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1914023,"PostDate":1464252480,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I have mixed feedback for my dress that I got from dressilyme. I picked a dress STYLE NO. WWD19107 for my wedding. I picked it in Ivory. It got beautiful tulle fabric skirt outside and soft organza within. The lace appliqu\u00e9s were nice and was even on the dress. It shipped it to me on time and with care. Got it on 5th day after they shipped it from China. Coming back to my dress, I found the lace is different than what was in the picture. However, I love this one more. It got big leaves and looks so lovely. Love it. However, I have been working out and lost 10 pounds since I ordered the dress. It's not their fault! I took it to seamstress and got it fitted\u2026 I actually love it more than what I have ordered 3 weeks earlier.<\/p>\n<p>I would love to share the pictures of me in it. Unfortunately, I can't upload it from my iPad.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"rubyisred23@rediffmail.com","IpAddress":"223.29.205.126","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1463714168,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Helenio","Id":286987,"Name":"Helenio","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"155.94.227.70","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69230,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1465447168,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5964de37e3f69307cb1b09e9f98ae003","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;You can buy wedding dress from Lady Collect. They have huge variety of wedding dresses like short sleeve wedding dress, full sleeve, sleeveless, black, white &amp;amp; red.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1914286,"PostDate":1465447032,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>You can buy wedding dress from Lady Collect. They have huge variety of wedding dresses like short sleeve wedding dress, full sleeve, sleeveless, black, white & red.\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ladycollect7@gmail.com","IpAddress":"112.196.17.132","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1465446065,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"ladycollect","Id":287108,"Name":"ladycollect","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"39.36.237.59","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69230,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f80a06e716f531e032f6797649f54d62","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:&#039;times new roman&#039;, serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12pt;\"&gt;It was very first time I shopped from some online store. I had listened many people\u2019s good and bad opinions for shopping online, but thanks God every thing was okay and I got my favorite dress (sleeveless mini dress) for my friend\u2019s birthday. Dressilyme delivered my selected dress few days before the party. I like that they made it what I wanted and selected on the website. Stuff quality was good and I got the value of my price. Thanks and I\u2019ll definitely come back to this website with some new order because it is hard to find a good online store every time.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[{"Id":35973,"Name":"1.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2016\/post-287188-0-59119700-1466161493.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2016\/post-287188-0-59119700-1466161493_thumb.jpg","Width":480,"Height":669},{"Id":35974,"Name":"2.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2016\/post-287188-0-31261300-1466161521.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2016\/post-287188-0-31261300-1466161521_thumb.jpg","Width":480,"Height":603}],"Id":1914432,"PostDate":1466147139,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p><span  style=\"font-family:'times new roman', serif;\"><span  style=\"font-size:12pt\">It was very first time I shopped from some online store. I had listened many people\u2019s good and bad opinions for shopping online, but thanks God every thing was okay and I got my favorite dress (sleeveless mini dress) for my friend\u2019s birthday. Dressilyme delivered my selected dress few days before the party. I like that they made it what I wanted and selected on the website. Stuff quality was good and I got the value of my price. Thanks and I\u2019ll definitely come back to this website with some new order because it is hard to find a good online store every time.<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ssam81663@gmail.com","IpAddress":"39.36.84.140","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1466136744,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"sonia002","Id":287188,"Name":"sonia002","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":41,"TotalPages":5,"CurrentPage":30,"NextPage":40,"PreviousPage":20,"LastPage":40},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
