:null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":53469,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"fde7ebee1a876859249a3b4abd3faecd","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Hi All,\n \n I&#039;ve taken enough from this forum so now it&#039;s time for me to start giving back. I am attaching the template for our key card holders. I hope it&#039;s helpful to someone.\n \n This is how I made them:\n \n 1.) I borrowed (downloaded) a template that someone had posted on here (Sorry but I don&#039;t remember who). I think raslin&lt;img alt=\"\" border=\"0\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/huh.gif\" title=\"Huh\" \/&gt;\n \n 2.)I changed the word (from Jamaica) to one of our engagement photos.\n \n 3.) I tweaked the colors to fit us.\n \n 4.) I printed them out on a colored laser printer on white cardstock from Walmart. It was about $6.00 for a ream.\n \n 5.) I glued the cardstock to construction paper to help become even more sturdy.\n \n 6.) I cut the lines with a paper cutter.\n \n 7.) Then I inserted each cutout into a waterproof plastic pouch that I bought off ebay from gcishoponline. The cost was $5.99 for 50 plus $5.00 for shipping. Total was $10.99.\n \n 8.) We purchased lanyards from the same ebay seller. The cost was $12.99 for 50 with free shipping. We also purchased wristband\/coil key chains and beltclip key chains because we wanted our guests to have a choice. The costs for them was supercheap--$2.99 for 12 coils and $2.99 for 50 beltclips on Oriental Trading.\n \n I also ordered 200 lanyard snaps fro $2.99 from Oriental Trading so it would be easier to put the pouches on the wrist coils.\n \n This is enough material to make 50 keycard holders for less than $1.00 each.\n \n I have attached the template. I&#039;m sorry I couldn&#039;t attach a pic but someone stole my digital camera and I have yet to buy another one.\n \n Let me know if you have any questions.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;u&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;EDIT-The pics are at post #16.&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/em&gt;&lt;\/u&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;span huddler_attributes=\"{&amp;quot;plugin&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;attachment&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;params&amp;quot;:{&amp;quot;id&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;7374&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;name&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;our keycard holder.ppt&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;description&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;size&amp;quot;:192,&amp;quot;type&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;ppt&amp;quot;}}\" huddler_plugin=\"attachment\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1192728,"PostDate":1277226263,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Hi All,<br \/> <br \/> I've taken enough from this forum so now it's time for me to start giving back. I am attaching the template for our key card holders. I hope it's helpful to someone.<br \/> <br \/> This is how I made them:<br \/> <br \/> 1.) I borrowed (downloaded) a template that someone had posted on here (Sorry but I don't remember who). I think raslin<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" border=\"0\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/huh.gif\" title=\"Huh\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> 2.)I changed the word (from Jamaica) to one of our engagement photos.<br \/> <br \/> 3.) I tweaked the colors to fit us.<br \/> <br \/> 4.) I printed them out on a colored laser printer on white cardstock from Walmart. It was about $6.00 for a ream.<br \/> <br \/> 5.) I glued the cardstock to construction paper to help become even more sturdy.<br \/> <br \/> 6.) I cut the lines with a paper cutter.<br \/> <br \/> 7.) Then I inserted each cutout into a waterproof plastic pouch that I bought off ebay from gcishoponline. The cost was $5.99 for 50 plus $5.00 for shipping. Total was $10.99.<br \/> <br \/> 8.) We purchased lanyards from the same ebay seller. The cost was $12.99 for 50 with free shipping. We also purchased wristband\/coil key chains and beltclip key chains because we wanted our guests to have a choice. The costs for them was supercheap--$2.99 for 12 coils and $2.99 for 50 beltclips on Oriental Trading.<br \/> <br \/> I also ordered 200 lanyard snaps fro $2.99 from Oriental Trading so it would be easier to put the pouches on the wrist coils.<br \/> <br \/> This is enough material to make 50 keycard holders for less than $1.00 each.<br \/> <br \/> I have attached the template. I'm sorry I couldn't attach a pic but someone stole my digital camera and I have yet to buy another one.<br \/> <br \/> Let me know if you have any questions.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <u><em><strong>EDIT-The pics are at post #16.<\/strong><\/em><\/u><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <span huddler_attributes=\"{\"plugin\":\"attachment\",\"params\":{\"id\":\"7374\",\"name\":\"our keycard holder.ppt\",\"description\":\"\",\"size\":192,\"type\":\"ppt\"}}\" huddler_plugin=\"attachment\">\u00a0<\/span>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>The Royal Playa del Carmen 12.11.10 \/ 46 people + bride & groom attended!!!!!<\/span><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/f103\/our-key-card-holders-60637\/\">Our keycard holders w\/ template & pics<\/a><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.jadicaandraveyn.com\">www.jadicaandraveyn.com<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"msglave@sbcglobal.net","IpAddress":"162.229.216.240","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1254163671,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-222084.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"msglave","Id":222084,"Name":"msglave","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":53469,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"00274d7cf10c3db959957f368d926ee2","RawContent":"Thanks for sharing, it looks great","Attachments":[],"Id":1192735,"PostDate":1277226556,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Thanks for sharing, it looks great\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>65 BOOKED PLUS BRIDE & GROOM<\/span><br><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/global.theknot.com\/tools\/tickers\/tt22b9e.aspx\">http:\/\/global.theknot.com\/tools\/tickers\/tt22b9e.aspx<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"dmvega@optimum.net","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1238114546,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl"