ds so you don&#039;t have to click on the attachment. Sorry, but I didn&#039;t know how to merge it with the first post. I matched the belt clip with the wrist coil (yellow with yellow, green with green, etc.) as you&#039;ll see on the pic. As I stated in the first post, we are using lanyards, belt clips and wristcoils so guests will have their choice of which they want to use. Obviously, they will remove the two they decide not to use or can swap depending on their mood. Hope this helps!\n \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i29.tinypic.com\/2s6x5op.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i31.tinypic.com\/154x02e.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i28.tinypic.com\/2zqexqg.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1216824,"PostDate":1279150969,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi Ladies, <br \/> <br \/> I am uploading pics of our key cards so you don't have to click on the attachment. Sorry, but I didn't know how to merge it with the first post. I matched the belt clip with the wrist coil (yellow with yellow, green with green, etc.) as you'll see on the pic. As I stated in the first post, we are using lanyards, belt clips and wristcoils so guests will have their choice of which they want to use. Obviously, they will remove the two they decide not to use or can swap depending on their mood. Hope this helps!<br \/> <br \/> 